today I'm going to show you how to set  up a professional PHP environment in the  cloud using zend server with Google  Cloud launcher after starting the cloud  launch or home page click infrastructure  then click then server next click launch  on compute engine select an existing  project or create a new one for your  xenserver instance for this example I'll  pick an existing project then click  continue after the page loads you can  configure your new instance give the  instance a name and deployment zone you  can also configure additional details  that apply to your project when you're  finished click the deploy button at the  bottom once it is loaded you'll see all  the details you need to get started with  your xenserver instance note the  username and password and click Launch  that brings up the xenserver login page  type your username and password and  click login that's all there is to it to  get started with the xenserver on cloud  launcher click on the link in the  comments and thanks for watching
 

